# Marquee

Marquee is a movie search app that lets you browse, search, and discover films using live data from the OMDb API.

## Demo
[Live site link, once deployed] Coming soon

## Features
- Search movies by title
- View movie details (poster, year, rating, etc.)
- Browse results in a clean layout
- Genre links with family-friendly and genre filtering
- Loading animation
- Friendly "no results" message and backup posters
- Responsive design for phones, tablets, and desktops
- Metallic shimmer title and hover effects

## Built With
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

## How to Run
1. Clone the repo
2. Open `index.html` in your browser

